      "releaseNotes": "Neighborhood names are complicated; people know where they live in ways maps don't always capture, and we're still learning how to name areas in a way that's useful to you.\n\nThis update is a small step: when you submit a report, you'll see a few nearby neighborhood options to pick from. Choose what fits, or tell us none do. Either way, you're helping us get this more accurate over time.",
